<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>Prosus in the media — {{ span }}</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #ffffff; --fg: #1a1a1a; --muted: #5c5c5c; --card: #f4f5f7; --line: #d6d8dc;
  --accent: #1f4fd1;
  --positive: #2e7d32; --neutral: #767c86; --negative: #bf360c;
  --neutral-text: #5f6570; --negative-text: #bf360c; --positive-text: #2e7d32;
  --grid: #b4b8bf; --banner-bg: #fff3c4; --banner-fg: #4a3b00; --banner-line: #c9a400;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #121417; --fg: #e9eaec; --muted: #a3a7ae; --card: #1d2025; --line: #3a3e45;
    --accent: #8fb0ff;
    --positive: #5cbf62; --neutral: #9aa0a8; --negative: #ff7a4d;
    --neutral-text: #9aa0a8; --negative-text: #ff7a4d; --positive-text: #5cbf62;
    --grid: #3a3e45; --banner-bg: #3a3000; --banner-fg: #ffe9a0; --banner-line: #b38f00;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
body {
  margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
  font: 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
}
main, footer { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.25; margin: 28px 0 6px; }
h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 36px 0 12px; }
p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
a { color: var(--accent); }
.sub { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 20px; }
.banner { background: var(--banner-bg); color: var(--banner-fg); border: 2px solid var(--banner-line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 0 0 20px; font-weight: 600; }
.note { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; margin: 10px 0 0; }
.tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
@media (min-width: 720px) { .tiles { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
.tile { background: var(--card); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; min-width: 0; }
.tile .k { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; }
.tile .v { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 4px 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.tile .v.small { font-size: 1.15rem; }
.tile .c { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); }
.split { font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; margin: 4px 0; }
.split span { display: block; }
.charts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
@media (min-width: 720px) { .charts { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
figure { margin: 0; background: var(--card); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; min-width: 0; }
figcaption { font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }
svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
svg.diagram { max-width: 560px; }
svg text { fill: var(--fg); font-family: inherit; }
svg .muted { fill: var(--muted); }
svg .axis { stroke: var(--grid); stroke-width: 1; }
svg .positive { fill: var(--positive); }
svg .neutral { fill: var(--neutral); }
svg .negative { fill: var(--negative); }
svg .bar { fill: var(--accent); }
svg .box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--fg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
svg .link { stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
svg .arrow { fill: var(--muted); }
.latest { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .92rem; }
.latest th, .latest td { text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
.latest th { font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; }
.latest .d { width: 4.6rem; white-space: nowrap; }
.latest .o { width: 11rem; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.latest .s { width: 6.6rem; white-space: nowrap; }
.latest .h a, .latest .o2 { display: block; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.latest .o2 { display: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
.sent::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: .7em; height: .7em; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: .35em; background: currentColor; }
.sent.positive { color: var(--positive-text); }
.sent.neutral { color: var(--neutral-text); }
.sent.negative { color: var(--negative-text); }
@media (max-width: 599px) {
  .latest .o, .latest .s { display: none; }
  .latest .o2 { display: block; }
  .latest .d { width: 3.7rem; }
  .latest th, .latest td { padding: 8px 4px; }
}
footer { color: var(--fg); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; }
footer h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 28px; }
.status { color: var(--muted); margin: 4px 0; }
ul.adds { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; }
.empty { color: var(--muted); padding: 20px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Prosus in the media — {{ span }}</h1>
<p class="sub">Public sources only, tagged by AI, reviewed by Jack Niu. Built for the AI Automation Intern application.</p>
{% if sample_banner %}
<p class="banner" role="note">Demo data: these {{ n_rows }} rows are synthetic, for layout only. Real coverage replaces them after the first run.</p>
{% endif %}

<section class="tiles" aria-label="Key numbers">
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="k">Articles found</div>
    <div class="v">{{ n_prosus if n_prosus else "No articles" }}</div>
    <div class="c">Prosus articles; peers counted separately</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="k">Sentiment split</div>
    {% if n_valid %}
    <div class="split">
      <span style="color: var(--positive-text)">{{ sent_pct.positive }}% positive</span>
      <span style="color: var(--neutral-text)">{{ sent_pct.neutral }}% neutral</span>
      <span style="color: var(--negative-text)">{{ sent_pct.negative }}% negative</span>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="v small">No articles</div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="c">Tone of Prosus coverage</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="k">Share of voice</div>
    <div class="v">{{ (sov ~ "%") if sov is not none else "No articles" }}</div>
    <div class="c">Prosus share of all articles about Prosus, Delivery Hero and Zalando</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="k">Top outlet</div>
    {% if top_outlet %}
    <div class="v small">{{ top_outlet.name }}</div>
    <div class="c">Published the most Prosus articles ({{ top_outlet.count }})</div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="v small">No articles</div>
    <div class="c">Publisher with the most Prosus articles</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<h2>Coverage over time and by topic</h2>
<div class="charts">
  <figure>
    <figcaption>Prosus articles per week, by tone</figcaption>
    {% if weekly.empty %}
    <p class="empty">No articles</p>
    {% else %}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 {{ weekly.W }} {{ weekly.H }}" role="img" aria-label="Prosus articles per week, stacked by sentiment">
      {% for s in sentiments %}
      <rect class="{{ s }}" x="{{ 44 + loop.index0 * 130 }}" y="10" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/>
      <text x="{{ 68 + loop.index0 * 130 }}" y="28" font-size="22">{{ s | capitalize }}</text>
      {% endfor %}
      {% for t in weekly.ticks %}
      <line class="axis" x1="{{ weekly.left }}" x2="{{ weekly.right }}" y1="{{ t.y }}" y2="{{ t.y }}"/>
      <text class="muted" x="{{ weekly.left - 8 }}" y="{{ t.y + 7 }}" font-size="22" text-anchor="end">{{ t.v }}</text>
      {% endfor %}
      {% for b in weekly.bars %}
      {% for seg in b.segs %}
      <rect class="{{ seg.cls }}" x="{{ seg.x }}" y="{{ seg.y }}" width="{{ seg.w }}" height="{{ seg.h }}"><title>{{ seg.n }} {{ seg.cls }}</title></rect>
      {% endfor %}
      <text x="{{ b.cx }}" y="{{ b.ty }}" font-size="22" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">{{ b.total }}</text>
      {% if loop.index0 % weekly.label_every == 0 %}
      <text class="muted" x="{{ b.cx }}" y="{{ weekly.label_y }}" font-size="22" text-anchor="middle">{{ b.label }}</text>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      <text class="muted" x="{{ (weekly.left + weekly.right) / 2 }}" y="{{ weekly.H - 6 }}" font-size="22" text-anchor="middle">Week starting (Monday)</text>
    </svg>
    {% endif %}
  </figure>
  <figure>
    <figcaption>What Prosus coverage is about</figcaption>
    {% if topics.empty %}
    <p class="empty">No articles</p>
    {% else %}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 {{ topics.W }} {{ topics.H }}" role="img" aria-label="Prosus articles by topic">
      {% for r in topics.rows %}
      <text x="{{ topics.label_w - 10 }}" y="{{ r.ty }}" font-size="22" text-anchor="end">{{ r.label }}</text>
      {% if r.w > 0 %}<rect class="bar" x="{{ topics.label_w }}" y="{{ r.y + 6 }}" width="{{ r.w }}" height="{{ topics.bar_h }}" rx="3"/>{% endif %}
      <text x="{{ r.cx }}" y="{{ r.ty }}" font-size="22" font-weight="600">{{ r.count }}</text>
      {% endfor %}
    </svg>
    {% endif %}
  </figure>
</div>
{% if n_excluded %}
<p class="note">{{ n_excluded }} of {{ n_prosus }} Prosus rows excluded from charts: missing or unrecognised sentiment, topic or date.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Latest Prosus coverage</h2>
{% if latest %}
<table class="latest">
  <thead>
    <tr><th class="d" scope="col">Date</th><th class="o" scope="col">Outlet</th><th class="h" scope="col">Headline</th><th class="s" scope="col">Sentiment</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for r in latest %}
    <tr>
      <td class="d"><time datetime="{{ r.iso }}">{{ r.date }}</time></td>
      <td class="o">{{ r.outlet }}</td>
      <td class="h"><a href="{{ r.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="{{ r.title }}">{{ r.title }}</a><span class="o2">{{ r.outlet }} · <span class="sent {{ r.sentiment }}">{{ r.sentiment }}</span></span></td>
      <td class="s"><span class="sent {{ r.sentiment }}">{{ r.sentiment }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<p class="note">The {{ latest | length }} most recent Prosus articles. Headlines open the original article.</p>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">No articles</p>
{% endif %}
</main>

<footer>
  <h2>How this page is made</h2>
  <svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 500 140" role="img" aria-label="Pipeline: Collect, Tag, Review, Page">
    {% set steps = [("Collect", "RSS +|Google News"), ("Tag", "Claude|classifies"), ("Review", "Human|spot-checks|tags"), ("Page", "Static|HTML")] %}
    {% for name, cap in steps %}
    {% set x = 14 + loop.index0 * 124 %}
    <rect class="box" x="{{ x }}" y="10" width="100" height="44" rx="8"/>
    <text x="{{ x + 50 }}" y="38" font-size="17" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">{{ name }}</text>
    {% for line in cap.split("|") %}
    <text class="muted" x="{{ x + 50 }}" y="{{ 78 + loop.index0 * 21 }}" font-size="17" text-anchor="middle">{{ line }}</text>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if not loop.last %}
    <line class="link" x1="{{ x + 102 }}" y1="32" x2="{{ x + 116 }}" y2="32"/>
    <polygon class="arrow" points="{{ x + 122 }},32 {{ x + 115 }},27 {{ x + 115 }},37"/>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </svg>

  <p class="status">{{ accuracy }}</p>
  <p class="status">{{ cost }}</p>

  <h2>What a paid media-monitoring licence (Meltwater, Cision) adds</h2>
  <ul class="adds">
    <li>Paywalled press</li>
    <li>Print</li>
    <li>Broadcast</li>
    <li>Audience figures</li>
    <li>Journalist database</li>
  </ul>

  <p><a href="#">Source code (link added on publish)</a></p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
